ProjectTaskDetail.description:
A task or subtask. decimal? ProjectTaskDetail.ActualPercentComplete is the figure its owner entered (a leaf's only);
decimal ProjectTaskDetail.PercentComplete is the task's progress as ADR-009 rolls it up: a leaf's own, a parent's the planned-duration
weighted mean of its live subtasks, 100 once COMPLETED. int ProjectTaskDetail.SubtaskCount counts the live subtasks.

ScheduleActivityRequest.description:
An activity's inputs, as a whole (R-5): its place in the work breakdown, its WBS code and name, and — for a leaf — the
requested start and the duration in working days. Planned and forecast dates are calculated, never sent (DCL-SCH-03);
an unknown property is ignored.

UserDetail.description:
ADM-003 User Detail. DateTimeOffset? UserDetail.MobileVerifiedAt is null until the holder of the number has confirmed it (ADR-004);
string UserDetail.PreferredLanguage is `ar` or `en`. A disabled user keeps every attribute, so a record they owned
or acted on still names them (Appendix A.1). The Nafath reference itself is never returned (OQ-007).
